{"title": "Slayer Knowledge", "pageid": 34287, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Slayer_Knowledge", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Slayer Knowledge</b> is a special passive feature granted to you by a book from <a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\">Volo</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on Saving Throws against being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> by a Bhaalspawn Slayer - the tome Volo found was <em>very</em> informative. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_VoloFate_SlayerKnowledge</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_VoloFate_SlayerKnowledge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_VoloFate_SlayerKnowledge\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted after reading the book <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Regarding_the_Slayer\" title=\"Regarding the Slayer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Regarding_the_Slayer\" title=\"Regarding the Slayer\">Regarding the Slayer</a> given to you by <a href=\"/wiki/Volo\" title=\"Volo\">Volo</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Grants advantage specifically against a <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer</a>'s <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Relentless_Lunge\" title=\"Relentless Lunge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp/25px-Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp/38px-Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp/50px-Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Relentless Lunge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp/25px-Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Relentless_Lunge_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Relentless_Lunge\" title=\"Relentless Lunge\">Relentless Lunge</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Growl\" title=\"Piercing Growl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp/25px-Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp/38px-Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp/50px-Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing Growl\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp/25px-Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Piercing_Growl_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Growl\" title=\"Piercing Growl\">Piercing Growl</a> abilities. Contrary to the tooltip, it grants advantage against the entire ability, not just the Frightened status.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714231754\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1568/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13427/4194304 bytes\